    "heading": "Level 3: Barbarian Subclass",
    "lineStart": 2323,
    "lineEnd": 2325
  },
  "section": "3.12",
  "rulesText": "You gain a Barbarian subclass of your choice. The Path of the Berserker subclass is detailed after this class's description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Barbarian levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Barbarian level or lower."
}
